VALUES (N'Annual Investment Review', N'Client reporting', N'The full annual review: letter, snapshot, performance (TWR and MWR), household and entities, allocation, holdings, structured products, currency, changes, commentary, costs and disclosures.', '2026-09-01T09:00:00');
